+    <article id="mars-surface-power" class="title-slide" data-transition="direct" data-notes="Michael Chappell, Deputy Mars Architecture Lead, Strategy and Architecture Office, NASA – ESDMD – SAO. Presented at the Moon to Mars Architecture Workshops in February 2025.">
+      <div class="title-main"><h1>Mars Surface Power</h1></div>
